github.com/users/HyperbolicHadron","html_url":"https://github.com/HyperbolicHadron","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HyperbolicHadron/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HyperbolicHadron/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HyperbolicHadron/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HyperbolicHadron/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HyperbolicHadron/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HyperbolicHadron/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HyperbolicHadron/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HyperbolicHadron/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HyperbolicHadron/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-11T19:16:27Z","updated_at":"2025-03-12T03:37:00Z","body":"I have narrowed down the problem to being an issue with the font fallbacks system in Godot during import. If the fallbacks are removed in the project for each font's .import file, then the issue goes away. This PR shows what this temporary fix looks like for a project: https://github.com/Revolutionary-Games/Thrive/pull/6008\n\nWe are currently unable to use this temporary fix in our project however, as the fallbacks are necessary for us.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2715452851/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2716694458","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103696#issuecomment-2716694458","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103696","id":2716694458,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6h7Xe6","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node